          <profiles>
            <profile name="Retaliation" id="8786-3c1a-2ea6-fb40" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When this model suffers Wounds in a Melee Exchange, at the end of the Exchange the attacker suffers one Wound ignoring Tough.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Starting Phase" id="42fa-9246-1af1-cc28" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">During the Starting Phase you may choose one of the following:
- Remove this model from play and all models gain Cover and Slow until the End Phase.  This is a Blizzard.
- Up to 1 Friendly model in BtB gains a Mirror Token.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Kami of Reflection" id="8e0e-dedf-6200-e9f3" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When a model with a Mirror Token becomes the Target of an Enemy Ki Feat you may spend the Mirror Token to cause the Ki Feat to instead Target the model using the Ki Feat as if that model were the original Target (ignoring restrictions).

This model does not gain Slow from Blizzard.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
