            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">During the End Phase if this model is in BtB with an Enemy non-Soulless model that is Held, the Enemy model suffers 2 Wounds and gains a Spirit Block Marker.
Also, this model gains a number of Ki Tokens equal to the Enemy model&apos;s Ki Statistic and the Enemy model loses that amount of Ki (if it has any).
If this model becomes Prone, it loses all Ki tokens and gains a Spirit Block Marker.</characteristic>
