              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When this model Channels Ki Tokens to chosen Friendly model, that model gains one of the following effects until the End Phase: 
- Resistance (+1)
- Courage (+1)
- Range Defence (+1)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Ancestor Spirit" id="c45a-083a-25a2-1e37" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When a Friendly model within 6&quot; is removed from play this model gains a number of Ki Tokens equal to the removed model&apos;s Ki Statistic.

This model may be recruited into Themes as if it were a Faction model.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
