              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">During the Starting Phase choose 1 of the following:
- Remove this model from play and choose 1 model in BtB. That model&apos;s Melee Weapons gain Sharp (1), Pierce (1), and Brutal (+1) until the End Phase.
- Choose 1 model in BtB. That model&apos;s Melee Weapons gain Sharp (1), and Pierce (1).</characteristic>
