          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">While Attached model is within 6&quot; of an Enemy model, Friendly Loyal models with LOS to the Attached model gain Banzai!.
Friendly models with LOS to Attached model gain Vengeance [Prefecture].

