        <profile name="The Hozumi Family" id="04e0-d39a-47f5-106e" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">- Friendly models begin the game with 1 Ki Token.
- Hozumi, Taiyo and Ryokeen models may always be recruited into this theme.
- In the Starting Phase you may choose 1 Enemy model to gain the Aloof Trait until the End Phase.
- In the Starting Phase, choose 1 Friendly, non-Hozumi model. That model gains Coordinated Attack [Hozumi] until the End Phase.

Permitted [Hozumi, Taiyo, Ryokeen, Ronin models]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
