      <profiles>
        <profile name="Inducted into the Miko" id="b89a-7323-52e2-95e9" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">While this model is in play, when a Friendly model spends a Virtue Token you may choose the following effect:
- You may force a Damage Roll against this model to be re-rolled.

If this model is recruited into a Warband with Hozumi Koga, Koga and this model begin the game with a Virtue Token.
This model may be recruited into any Warband that has recruited Hozumi Koga but not The Hozumi Family Theme.

Requirement [Kiyozumi Hinadori]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
