      <profiles>
        <profile name="The Oncoming Storm" id="fbcf-5641-d7b1-99f3" hidden="false" typeId="bd15-7ead-9268-3576" typeName="Special Card (Ki Feat)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="17eb-17e2-4df4-5c5d">- Enemy models within 3&quot; of this model lose the Cloudwalk trait.
- In the End Phase, you may add a Blind Marker to every Enemy model that removes a Stunned Marker (Do not remove these Blind Markers this turn). If you do, discard this card.
Requirement [The Dark Pilgrim]
- Attached model gains the following Ki Feat:</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Name" typeId="27c7-1649-f16e-8eaa">Storm Mistress</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="e410-b220-64e5-7953">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="b9bf-562a-fe26-cb29">Active</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Subject" typeId="47b8-f739-9d50-2e45">Special</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Limitation" typeId="870e-79e4-80ee-c0cc">Once Per Turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ki Feat Description" typeId="3886-242b-fb70-5c88">Replace this model by Summoning and Deploying any Ronin Lesser Air Kami (Ignoring which Faction may recruit that model), remove this model and place it Elsewhere.
You still cannot have more of that Kami models in play than the Max value on its card.
If this model is Elsewhere, it may use this feat. Replace a Friendly Ronin Lesser Air Kami that you own with this model. Remove the Kami from play.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
