        <profile name="Spark of Life" id="6cf5-bfee-d2aa-1259" hidden="false" typeId="bd15-7ead-9268-3576" typeName="Special Card (Ki Feat)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="17eb-17e2-4df4-5c5d">- If a Friendly model is Killed while within 6&quot;, you may return it to play with one wound box unmarked in BtB with the Attached model and discard this card.
- Attached model can be recruited into the Descension faction.
Requirement [Grey Pilgrim]
- Attached model gains the following Ki Feat:</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Name" typeId="27c7-1649-f16e-8eaa">Shield of Light</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="e410-b220-64e5-7953">X</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="b9bf-562a-fe26-cb29">Instant</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Subject" typeId="47b8-f739-9d50-2e45">Pulse 3&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Limitation" typeId="870e-79e4-80ee-c0cc">Once Per Turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ki Feat Description" typeId="3886-242b-fb70-5c88">When a Friendly Model within the Pulse is successfully attacked in a Melee Exchange, before the Damage Roll spend X Ki Tokens. X may not be greater than 3.
For each Ki Token spent, prevent one Wound.
The model making the attack gains a Stunned Marker.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
