              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model and Kiyozumi models may be included in themes as if they were Faction models.
This model must use Fortune.
This model cannot Leech from Servants. In the End Phase if this model has not Leached 2 Ki, it gains a Control Marker.
This model may have more than 1 Enhancement - Equipment card Attached to it.
This model ignores Slow from Blizzard.</characteristic>
