          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">When an Enemy Samurai or Prince model declares a Melee or Charge action which will bring it into BtB with, or Targets this model, it must make a Challenge (7) Ki Test.
If the Enemy model is successful, resolve the Action as normal. If unsuccessful, its activation ends after any movement but with no Melee Exchange and it removes one Activation Counter.
