        <infoGroup name="Unique Effects" id="7433-6535-0428-5633" hidden="false">
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Unique Effects" id="3539-4ab9-1672-4d4f" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model cannot be Targeted by Friendly Tengu models and cannot be Channelled to or Leeched from.


When this model declares a Run Action it gains +1 Move until the end of the activation.
This model does not suffer Melee penalties for having Run.


While this model is on the Battlefield, Opponents cannot use effects on Profile Cards and Special Cards that allow additional scenario points to be scored.


This model may be recruited into any Warband that has recruited Hiroto.
This model may be recruited into Descension Themes as if it were a Faction model.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
