            <profile name="Unique Effects" id="f8d9-eed6-d854-aaee" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">Whenever this model is required to roll a Ki Test you may choose to roll for this model as if for a Size Test instead.
For this model&apos;s test; apply any modifiers, re-rolls, substitutions, bonuses or penalties as applies to Size Test.
This does not change the Challenge Number and the Opponent rolls as normal if an Opposed test.

Many of this model&apos;s Statistics and Traits values are variable. X is equal to the number of Ki Tokens on this model&apos;s profile card.

This model cannot be Channeled to or Leeched from.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
